+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+With extended display on, the background turns red after it detects a lead within 60 m at an absolute speed of 0.8 m/s or less for 0.5 s. If the lead moves off while you are still moving, the normal background returns. Green appears when your car pulls away from a red stop.
